# Krater Pro Homebrew tap

The CLI formula installs Krater Pro, Node.js 22, locked production
dependencies, shell completions, and the manual page in one command on macOS,
Linux, and WSL 2:

```sh
brew install {{TAP_REPOSITORY}}/krater-pro
krater setup
krater doctor
```

The native macOS desktop application remains a separate signed and notarized
cask:

```sh
brew install --cask {{TAP_REPOSITORY}}/krater-pro-app
```

Native Windows desktop distribution uses a signed WinGet package rather than
pretending that a WSL Homebrew formula can install a Windows application.

Formula and cask updates are generated only from checksum-verified Krater Pro
GitHub Release assets. Pull requests must pass native formula lifecycle tests
and macOS cask audit checks before merge.

If `Formula/krater-pro.rb` or `Casks/krater-pro-app.rb` is absent, that channel
has not shipped yet and the corresponding install command is intentionally not
available.
